## Commands

- CLI: `task etl -- <args>` (e.g. `sync --catalog`, `report`)
- Build: `task etl:build` (API build depends on this)

## Conventions

- Treat documented schemas and sync semantics as source of truth.
- Prefer extending the existing lib + CLI over new pipelines.
- Regenerate Mermaid SVGs with `task docs:diagrams` when editing `.mmd` sources.
